          "type": "text",
          "title": "Management’s demand commentary",
          "text": "ASML attributed demand for advanced Logic and Memory chips to AI-related investment and progress in AI technologies, and said customers were accelerating capacity expansion plans. This is management commentary, not a quantified market forecast.",
